  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:182px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/PygmyTracks.jpg\" title=\"Pygmy Tracks in the Forest\"><img alt=\"Pygmy Tracks in the Forest\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"113\" src=\"/images/PygmyTracks.jpg\" width=\"180\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/PygmyTracks.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Pygmy Tracks in the Forest</div></div></div><br/>\n<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:182px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/PygmyTracks2.jpg\" title=\"Pygmy Tracks in the Castle\"><img alt=\"Pygmy Tracks in the Castle\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"238\" src=\"/images/PygmyTracks2.jpg\" width=\"180\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/PygmyTracks2.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Pygmy Tracks in the Castle</div></div></div>\n<p>The tracks as an NPC will be found on the first level of <a href=\"/wiki/Widower's_Nest\" title=\"Widower's Nest\">Widower's Nest</a> just before the portal to <a href=\"/wiki/Widower's_Nest\" title=\"Widower's Nest\">Ruins of Castle Caninenstein</a>. It gives the quest\n</p>\n<ul><li> <a href=\"/wiki/Creature_Tracks:_Pygmy!\" title=\"Creature Tracks: Pygmy!\">Creature Tracks: Pygmy!</a>\n</li></ul>\n<p>Within Castle Caninenstein there are three more sets of tracks, and following them will lead to the Lair of the <a href=\"/wiki/Fiery_Pygmy\" title=\"Fiery Pygmy\">Fiery Pygmies</a>.  Killing their leader completes the quest.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
